                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Annex</hi> 4</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Special Provisions Relating to
                        Certain Kinds of Property</hi></p>
                <p>[Identical, <hi rendition="#italic">mutatis mutandis</hi>, to Annex 6 of the
                    Draft Italian Treaty and Annexes 4 A and 4 B of the Draft Rumanian Treaty with
                    the exception that the U.S. position specified at the end of A 4 of the Italian
                    and Rumanian annexes is not repeated here.]</p>
